# Only the viewer's own files are committed: Assets/ (code, shader, web page, tests),
# Packages/manifest.json and ProjectSettings/ProjectVersion.txt.
# Unity makes everything below again when the project is opened.

*.meta
.vsconfig
Packages/packages-lock.json
ProjectSettings/*
!ProjectSettings/ProjectVersion.txt

